    "blurb": "Create and manage Zoom meetings",
    "overview": "Automate Zoom meeting workflows in Camunda using a ready-to-use element template built on the REST connector. Create, update, retrieve and delete meetings, plus manage registrants and meeting details via the Zoom API.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Automate Zoom Meeting Management",
    "splashDescription": "The Camunda Zoom Connector enables teams to automate Zoom meeting creation and management directly from BPMN-based processes using Zoom's REST API. Use it to schedule meetings, retrieve/update/delete meetings, manage registrants, and access meeting-related details as part of an end-to-end process.",
